; easy: shifts is sorted by its composite key (sh_emp, sh_day), so the SORT is the identity; GE sh_hours, 1 is always TRUE (not_null + check [1,16])
LOAD   e, shifts.sh_emp
LOAD   d, shifts.sh_day
LOAD   h, shifts.sh_hours
GE     m, h, 1
IDX    i, m
GATHER e1, e, i
GATHER d1, d, i
GATHER h1, h, i
SORT   s, e1 ASC NF, d1 ASC NF
GATHER e2, e1, s
GATHER d2, d1, s
GATHER h2, h1, s
OUT    e2, d2, h2
